@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<div class="container py-5 text-white" style="font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; max-width:800px; margin:0 auto;">

    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        Dear Valued Guest,
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        At our cinema, we understand the inconvenience customers often face when buying tickets online — having to go to the venue again just to show your order ID for physical ticket validation. Our development team knows this pain and wanted to make your experience smoother.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        That’s why we integrated digital tickets combined with QR codes for validation. Now, you can simply buy a ticket online and head straight to entry. Show your QR code on your phone, let our staff scan it, and enjoy your movie without any stressful procedures.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        You can even purchase tickets without signing up — just visit our cinema website, complete the payment, and go. Every step is automated for your convenience.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        At Caligo Cinema, we strive to make your movie experience effortless, futuristic, and enjoyable. Thank you for choosing us, and we hope you enjoy your visit!
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top:30px;">
        Best regards,<br />
        <strong>Caligo Cinema Team</strong>
    </p>
</div>
